- For saving favorite pictures or creating an itinerary: Bookmark APIs like Pocket could be used but it is optional depending on if user's saving is client-side or server-side. This depends on complexity desired.  

Among the mapping APIs, OpenLayers is an open source, popular and flexible option. Mapbox also offers great tools for embedding and interacting with maps. Bing Maps and Google Maps have rich commercial options as well.  

Hence the best combination is:  
- Mapping: OpenLayers or Mapbox or Bing Maps (any of these)  
